   "source": [
    "## Loading Required Tables for Project – Group 10\n",
    "\n",
    "- `patients.csv` – Contains demographic information: date of birth (`dob`), gender (`gender`).\n",
    "- `admissions.csv` – Includes hospitalization details: admission time, discharge time, death time (`deathtime`), admission ID (`hadm_id`).\n",
    "- `icustays.csv` – Records ICU stays: ICU ID (`icustay_id`), admission and discharge times (`intime`, `outtime`).\n",
    "- `outputevents.csv` – Documents urine output measurements, filtered by known `itemid`s.\n",
    "- `diagnoses_icd.csv` – Provides patients' medical diagnoses using ICD-9 codes, utilized for identifying Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD).\n",
    "- `d_icd_diagnoses.csv` – Maps ICD-9 codes to full diagnostic titles (`long_title`), aiding in the identification of CKD.\n",
    "- `chartevents.csv` – Contains time-stamped physiological measurements such as heart rate and blood pressure.\n",
    "- `d_items.csv` – Maps `itemid` to labels, facilitating the identification of medical measurements in `chartevents`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 45,
   "id": "0e738005",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
